<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SJ Luxury Travel Ltd | Premium Travel & Experiences</title>
    <style>
        /* Base Styling */
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0d1b2a;
            --accent-color: #c5a059;
            --text-light: #f8f9fa;
            --text-dark: #212529;
            --bg-light: #f4f6f8;
            --font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-family);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Header & Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 1rem 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        header .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(13, 27, 42, 0.75), rgba(13, 27, 42, 0.75)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516426122078-c23e76319801?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: var(--primary-color);
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #e0b86c;
        }

        /* Notice Banner */
        .status-banner {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 1000px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .status-banner h3 {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* Features / Expect Section */
        .features {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        /* Contact Section */
        .contact {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .contact p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .contact a {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #081019;
            color: #8d99ae;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 10px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">SJ LUXURY TRAVEL LTD</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Guaranteed Holidays Beyond The Usual</h1>
        <p>We are upgrading our travel portal to bring you an elevated booking experience for custom safari expeditions and coastal villa getaways.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn">Request Custom Quote</a>
    </section>

    <!-- System Status Notice -->
    <div class="status-banner" id="about">
        <h3>System Update in Progress</h3>
        <p>Our online booking engine is currently being updated to serve you better. Direct inquiries and manual travel bookings remain open via our phone line and office desk.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- What to Expect / Services Section -->
    <section class="features" id="services">
        <h2 class="section-title">What To Expect Upon Relaunch</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Bespoke Logistics</h3>
                <p>Seamless flight bookings, executive SGR train transfers, chauffeured ground travel, and custom 4x4 safari Jeep allocations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Watamu Villa Getaways</h3>
                <p>Curated private villas and luxury coastal rentals tailored for relaxation across Kenya's finest beach destinations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Signature Destinations</h3>
                <p>Direct access to exclusive packages in Diani Beach, the Masai Mara, Mombasa, and cross-border expeditions in Tanzania & Zanzibar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Corporate & Global</h3>
                <p>Enterprise travel management, business exchange itineraries, group expeditions, and dedicated VIP concierge assistance.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Direct Contact Section -->
    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Direct Inquiries & Custom Quotes</h2>
        <p>Headquarters: Nairobi, Kenya</p>
        <p>Direct Phone Line: <a href="tel:+254794816245">+(254) 794816245</a></p>
        <p>Available Services: Custom Safari Quotes, Villa Reservations, Group Expeditions & Airport Transfers</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 SJ Luxury Travel Ltd. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
